<title>AUSTRALIA: News Corp says STAR TV yr results in line.</title>
<headline>News Corp says STAR TV yr results in line.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>News Corp Ltd said on Wednesday operating results from its Hong Kong-based satellite television arm STAR TV were in line with expectations for the year to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;STAR TV continues to strengthen and expand its position in its major targeted markets with operating results in line with expectations,&quot; News Corp said in a statement accompanying its 1996/97 results.</p>
<p>However, News Corp did not detail the STAR TV results.</p>
</text>
